    of the material can combine with its duplicate.","parentUIDs":[8],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Curie
    (Info NPC)","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":519,"yPos":829.001038},"ID":16,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"I''m
    not sure if that''s a good idea. But a screwdriver will be ideal. Hayden might
