    you could show me the recipe I might be able to figure out something","parentUIDs":[15],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Curie
    (Info NPC)","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":1038.00037,"yPos":831.001},"ID":18,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Screwdriver
