    (Info NPC)","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":1276,"yPos":827},"ID":23,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Crowbar
    is definitely rare around here... Maybe you can ask Hayden?","parentUIDs":[21],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Curie
    (Info NPC)","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":26}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":1512,"yPos":827},"ID":24,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Long
    ago there was a mass escape through that whole. Someone might have kept things
